<title>USA: Wall Street stocks higher at open.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks higher at open.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow industrials followed through on Monday's rally at the start of trading Tuesday and headed higher.</p>
<p>The Dow was up seven at 6913.</p>
</text>
